Write an XDP program that inspects GENEVE tunnel packets without options (gen->opt_len == 0). Use bpf_xdp_adjust_head(ctx, -8) to insert an 8-byte custom TLV option (Class 0x0100, Type 1, Length 1 word = 4 bytes of data 0xDEADBEEF). Update gen->opt_len to 2 (8 bytes), adjust UDP length by 8, and return XDP_PASS.

